<title>MEXICO: Celanese 6-month net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Celanese 6-month net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican textile and chemicals company Celanese SA said its six-month net profit was 527 million pesos, down 42 percent compared to the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Celanese said in a statement that its total sales during the year's first six months were 4.287 billion pesos, down 22 percent against the comparable period from 1996.</p>
</text>
